- For each entity, assign all FOUND attributes, remember that each entity has its specific attributes, for example:
    - Attributes for Record Resource: General Description, Identifier, Name, Authenticity Note, Classification, Conditions of Access, Conditions of Use, Content Type, History, Integrity Note, Language, Legal Status, Record Resource Extent, Scope and content, State, Structure
